window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Murder on the High Seas. Thomas Thornton reads the newspaper article.</p> <p>Can the murder of a young German man, fatally stabbed during a voyage out of London to Melbourne, have anything to do with the Thorntons? Alexandra’s curiosity is piqued when a Prussian Count, who travelled on the same ship, shows up at Thornton Antiques in search of a rare amber postage stamp.</p> <p>Alexandra Thornton and Benedict Archer have been married for one year. Benedict is estranged from his family, who own a vineyard in the Barossa Valley in South Australia. Alexandra urges him to try to heal the breach.</p> <p>Murder. A strange count searching for a rare stamp. A missing opal. A family in turmoil. How are they all connected?</p> <p>When a dark secret of betrayal and loss is exposed, Alexandra finds her world shattered.</p>"; 
